1
00:01:28,946 --> 00:01:34,751
BURNING LOVE! RYOTSU AND MARIA

2
00:01:36,887 --> 00:01:38,589
You moron!

3
00:01:40,057 --> 00:01:42,593
You're a fully-grown man. Have you no shame?

4
00:01:42,793 --> 00:01:44,761
I'm tired of having to lecture you.

5
00:01:44,962 --> 00:01:46,964
Then just stop lecturing me already.

6
00:01:47,164 --> 00:01:50,167
I have no choice. You're always late.

7
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,435
Look at me.

8
00:01:51,635 --> 00:01:55,405
I have a two-and-a-half hour commute, but I've never been late once.

9
00:01:55,606 --> 00:01:57,975
Well, you have your wife to wake you up.

10
00:01:58,175 --> 00:02:00,277
Not me. I'm a bachelor.

11
00:02:00,477 --> 00:02:01,979
And you're happy about that?

12
00:02:02,346 --> 00:02:03,981
You should find a partner!

13
00:02:04,181 --> 00:02:05,249
Get married?

14
00:02:05,883 --> 00:02:10,320
Of course. The only way to turn your life around is with a good old-fashioned wife.

15
00:02:10,554 --> 00:02:15,259
Get yourself a wife, have a few kids, buy a house, and be a real family man!

16
00:02:15,926 --> 00:02:17,494
A family man?

17
00:02:18,729 --> 00:02:20,130
Bye-bye, sweetie.

18
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:26,370
Eww, no way! I will never settle down.

19
00:02:26,603 --> 00:02:28,171
We all do eventually.

20
00:02:28,372 --> 00:02:31,175
In fact, I'll see to it that you get hitched.

21
00:02:31,375 --> 00:02:32,843
You can't force me.

22
00:02:33,043 --> 00:02:34,444
-Get married! -No way!

23
00:02:34,645 --> 00:02:35,913
Do it, do it, do it!

24
00:02:36,113 --> 00:02:37,981
I won't! I won't! I won't!

25
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:49,126
To think. Me? A family man?

26
00:02:49,493 --> 00:02:51,228
Yuck, gives me the creeps.

27
00:02:54,932 --> 00:02:57,668
Hey, why aren't you coming out? Come on!

28
00:03:01,371 --> 00:03:02,339
Ouch...

29
00:03:02,539 --> 00:03:03,874
I'm so sorry!

30
00:03:08,245 --> 00:03:10,981
Come on, love. Don't make us chase you.

31
00:03:11,181 --> 00:03:13,517
All you gotta do is come on a date, honey.

32
00:03:13,717 --> 00:03:14,518
Let go of me!

33
00:03:18,088 --> 00:03:19,823
-Michael! -Oh my God!

34
00:03:20,023 --> 00:03:21,258
What's your problem?

35
00:03:21,725 --> 00:03:24,261
You're the ones with the problem!

36
00:03:25,062 --> 00:03:26,396
And right now...

37
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:28,065
I'm in no mood...

38
00:03:28,432 --> 00:03:29,733
to tolerate...

39
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:31,435
scum like you!

40
00:03:31,668 --> 00:03:34,404
-Damn it! -You'll regret this!

41
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:37,574
Get back here! I'm not through with you!

42
00:03:38,342 --> 00:03:40,010
Thank you very much.

43
00:03:40,210 --> 00:03:41,411
And you should...

44
00:03:50,087 --> 00:03:51,722
I'm sorry for the trouble.

45
00:03:51,922 --> 00:03:55,859
Well, I am a police officer, so I was just doing my job.

46
00:03:56,059 --> 00:03:57,561
Um... can I ask your name?

47
00:03:57,995 --> 00:03:58,996
Huh? Me?

48
00:03:59,196 --> 00:04:03,600
Oh, uh, I'm Officer Kankichi Ryotsu from the Kameari Park Police Station.

49
00:04:03,834 --> 00:04:06,370
Ryotsu-san, from Kameari Park Police Station...

50
00:04:06,570 --> 00:04:07,537
Yeah...

51
00:04:07,738 --> 00:04:10,440
My name is Ai Asato.

52
00:04:10,674 --> 00:04:11,541
Ai... Asato?

53
00:04:12,042 --> 00:04:13,443
Asato is "linen village."

54
00:04:13,677 --> 00:04:14,911
And Ai is "love."

55
00:04:15,112 --> 00:04:18,782
But you can also read those characters as Ma-ri-a. So call me Maria.

56
00:04:19,216 --> 00:04:20,450
Maria...

57
00:04:20,684 --> 00:04:22,052
Yes, my Ryo-sama!

58
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:30,961
Maria, huh?

59
00:04:31,161 --> 00:04:34,965
Wow, get a load of my luck to cross paths with a babe like her.

60
00:04:35,165 --> 00:04:37,734
Yahoo!

61
00:04:41,705 --> 00:04:43,974
You've got a plan for Ryotsu?

62
00:04:44,641 --> 00:04:46,476
Shh, not so loud.

63
00:04:46,777 --> 00:04:51,281
You think Ryotsu would show up if I tried setting a regular blind date?

64
00:04:51,581 --> 00:04:55,485
Think of it as my way of turning Ryotsu into a family man.

65
00:04:55,886 --> 00:04:58,955
Hmm? No way I'm falling for the chief's stupid schemes.

66
00:05:01,625 --> 00:05:03,894
Ryotsu, what are you having for lunch?

67
00:05:04,094 --> 00:05:06,430
Hmm... Maybe some ramen from Tsurukame-ken.

68
00:05:06,963 --> 00:05:07,764
Excuse me...

69
00:05:08,832 --> 00:05:12,502
Is there someone here named Kankichi Ryotsu?

70
00:05:12,736 --> 00:05:13,837
Huh?

71
00:05:16,673 --> 00:05:17,474
Maria!

72
00:05:17,674 --> 00:05:19,343
My Ryo-sama! I came to see you!

73
00:05:20,444 --> 00:05:22,846
W-Who is that, Ryotsu?

74
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:26,183
Uh... Oh, just someone I know...

75
00:05:26,383 --> 00:05:27,684
So, why are you here?

76
00:05:27,918 --> 00:05:30,821
I made you lunch. As a thank you for earlier.

77
00:05:31,555 --> 00:05:33,190
Wow!

78
00:05:34,991 --> 00:05:36,827
This looks amazing!

79
00:05:37,027 --> 00:05:38,795
All right! Thanks for the grub!

80
00:05:42,299 --> 00:05:44,568
Whoa, that's good!

81
00:05:44,801 --> 00:05:47,938
Oh, thank goodness! I'm glad you like it.

82
00:05:48,138 --> 00:05:49,873
May I make lunch for you again?

83
00:05:50,107 --> 00:05:52,709
If it tastes this good, you're welcome anytime!

84
00:05:53,110 --> 00:05:57,547
Great! From now on, I'd like to make lunch for you every day.

85
00:06:00,984 --> 00:06:02,552
See you tomorrow, my Ryo-sama!

86
00:06:02,786 --> 00:06:04,354
Sure thing. I'll be waiting.

87
00:06:07,257 --> 00:06:11,061
Well, I guess I don't have to worry about lunch anymore.

88
00:06:11,261 --> 00:06:13,430
-Ryotsu! -How are you so calm?

89
00:06:13,663 --> 00:06:16,433
She wants to make all your meals for you.

90
00:06:16,666 --> 00:06:19,069
That means she wants to be your wife.

91
00:06:19,269 --> 00:06:20,070
My wife?

92
00:06:22,372 --> 00:06:23,573
No way!

93
00:06:24,207 --> 00:06:25,242
I'm telling you.

94
00:06:25,442 --> 00:06:28,245
She's beautiful, polite, and an amazing cook to boot.

95
00:06:28,445 --> 00:06:30,380
She'd be the perfect bride.

96
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:31,882
Bride?

97
00:06:32,282 --> 00:06:36,219
You old scamp, Ryotsu. You sure can pull the best.

98
00:06:36,453 --> 00:06:38,288
You'll propose right away, right?

99
00:06:38,522 --> 00:06:39,856
Propose?!

100
00:06:40,056 --> 00:06:41,625
You're perfect for each other.

101
00:06:41,858 --> 00:06:42,926
You are.

102
00:06:44,094 --> 00:06:46,596
Me and Maria... Husband and wife...

103
00:06:57,941 --> 00:07:01,178
This means you'll finally become a real family man.

104
00:07:01,378 --> 00:07:03,413
Well, she hasn't said yes yet...

105
00:07:03,747 --> 00:07:04,414
Huh?

106
00:07:04,614 --> 00:07:07,417
A family man? Wait a minute...

107
00:07:07,751 --> 00:07:09,719
I've got a plan for Ryotsu.

108
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,488
Could he mean Maria?

109
00:07:11,721 --> 00:07:13,723
She does seem a little too convenient.

110
00:07:13,924 --> 00:07:16,126
She got into trouble right in front of me,

111
00:07:16,426 --> 00:07:18,094
and she even came to thank me.

112
00:07:18,428 --> 00:07:20,730
And they're acting suspicious too.

113
00:07:27,637 --> 00:07:28,738
So that's his game.

114
00:07:28,939 --> 00:07:30,574
I get it now!

115
00:07:30,774 --> 00:07:33,243
"NIKONIKO DORMITORY"

116
00:07:39,049 --> 00:07:40,750
Maria is a nice girl.

117
00:07:40,951 --> 00:07:43,653
But the problem is she's friends with the chief.

118
00:07:43,887 --> 00:07:48,291
I don't want my wife connecting me to the chief for the rest of my days.

119
00:07:48,692 --> 00:07:51,328
Damn it all...

120
00:07:53,763 --> 00:07:55,332
Ryo-sama!

121
00:07:58,168 --> 00:08:00,003
My Ryo-sama!

122
00:08:00,470 --> 00:08:05,809
Maria!

123
00:08:06,009 --> 00:08:08,178
Ryo-sama, from this day forward...

124
00:08:08,378 --> 00:08:11,114
You'll be a real family man!

125
00:08:11,948 --> 00:08:14,284
Chief! Stop! Let go!

126
00:08:14,684 --> 00:08:16,653
-Stop it! -My Ryo-sama!

127
00:08:17,787 --> 00:08:19,456
Help me!

128
00:08:19,656 --> 00:08:21,358
No! Stop it, Chief!

129
00:08:21,558 --> 00:08:22,993
Don't kiss me!

130
00:08:23,193 --> 00:08:25,462
-Ryo-sama! Ryo-sama! -Huh?

131
00:08:26,997 --> 00:08:28,698
What's wrong, Ryo-sama?

132
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:32,702
-I had a terrible dream. -What kind of dream?

133
00:08:32,936 --> 00:08:35,805
You were there, but then you were the chief...

134
00:08:36,006 --> 00:08:36,706
Huh?

135
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:38,875
Why are you here, Maria?

136
00:08:39,109 --> 00:08:43,480
I'm here to prepare your breakfast, of course.

137
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:45,348
Huh? Uh...

138
00:09:02,198 --> 00:09:03,667
Eat up, Ryo-sama.

139
00:09:03,867 --> 00:09:05,735
Whoa, this looks delicious!

140
00:09:07,604 --> 00:09:11,675
No. I can't keep going along with their ruse.

141
00:09:13,777 --> 00:09:17,380
Right in the palm of my hand, Kankichi Ryotsu!

142
00:09:17,614 --> 00:09:20,016
No way, Chief. You're not getting your way.

143
00:09:20,216 --> 00:09:21,885
I have to steel my heart.

144
00:09:24,054 --> 00:09:25,889
What exactly is your plan here?

145
00:09:26,089 --> 00:09:26,890
Huh?

146
00:09:27,223 --> 00:09:30,193
Sneaking into a bachelor's pad first thing in the morning.

147
00:09:30,393 --> 00:09:32,329
Doing housework without permission.

148
00:09:32,529 --> 00:09:33,897
You're way out of line.

149
00:09:38,635 --> 00:09:41,905
Do I displease you, my Ryo-sama?

150
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:45,608
No, no, that's not what I meant.

151
00:09:46,242 --> 00:09:47,911
So you do like me?

152
00:09:48,878 --> 00:09:50,547
I'm so happy!

153
00:09:55,185 --> 00:09:57,554
That's not what I'm talking about.

154
00:09:57,754 --> 00:09:59,122
Let me make this clear.

155
00:09:59,623 --> 00:10:02,125
I have no intention of marrying you.

156
00:10:02,359 --> 00:10:03,827
But...

157
00:10:13,737 --> 00:10:16,272
This is... the right decision.

158
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,775
Chief!

159
00:10:20,210 --> 00:10:21,811
Chief, you are too cruel!

160
00:10:22,045 --> 00:10:24,080
How can you toy with people's hearts?

161
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,281
What do you mean?

162
00:10:25,482 --> 00:10:28,585
You sent someone for me to marry, didn't you?

163
00:10:29,786 --> 00:10:31,388
Oh, you figured it out?

164
00:10:31,588 --> 00:10:35,225
I did plan to set you up on a blind date,

165
00:10:35,425 --> 00:10:37,494
but the lady I had in mind refused.

166
00:10:37,694 --> 00:10:39,062
This is her.

167
00:10:39,929 --> 00:10:40,864
Eh?!

168
00:10:41,097 --> 00:10:42,699
So, Maria was...

169
00:10:48,271 --> 00:10:52,008
Damn it! I'm an absolute idiot!

170
00:12:00,743 --> 00:12:01,544
Ryo-sama?

171
00:12:05,749 --> 00:12:08,084
About this morning...

172
00:12:11,688 --> 00:12:16,226
I was thinking maybe I was out of line...

173
00:12:17,494 --> 00:12:21,698
Well... um... I guess I wouldn't mind... if you were my wife...

174
00:12:21,898 --> 00:12:22,799
I guess...

175
00:12:27,904 --> 00:12:28,705
Ryo-sama!

176
00:12:31,708 --> 00:12:32,609
I'm so happy!

177
00:12:32,809 --> 00:12:34,177
Really?

178
00:12:38,114 --> 00:12:40,183
"KAMEARI PARK POLICE STATION"

179
00:12:40,583 --> 00:12:42,218
I'll be back soon, Maria!

180
00:12:42,619 --> 00:12:44,521
I'll be waiting for you.

181
00:12:46,823 --> 00:12:47,957
I knew it.

182
00:12:48,191 --> 00:12:51,127
Ryotsu's put his head down now that he's got a family.

183
00:12:51,361 --> 00:12:56,065
This is the first time he's volunteered to go out and take community complaints.

184
00:12:56,266 --> 00:12:59,736
You see? I make a pretty good matchmaker.

185
00:13:12,682 --> 00:13:14,250
-Are you okay? -Yeah.

186
00:13:14,651 --> 00:13:15,919
Um, what's this?

187
00:13:16,586 --> 00:13:18,254
Oh, that's Ryuji Asato.

188
00:13:18,454 --> 00:13:20,390
Ryotsu is a big fan of his.

189
00:13:20,623 --> 00:13:21,925
Really?!

190
00:13:22,258 --> 00:13:25,161
Yeah. We often went to watch his fights.

191
00:13:25,395 --> 00:13:26,429
I'm so glad!

192
00:13:26,830 --> 00:13:30,466
So Ryo-sama has been watching over me all this time.

193
00:13:30,667 --> 00:13:33,169
We must be connected by the threads of fate!

194
00:13:36,039 --> 00:13:38,141
What are you talking about, Maria?

195
00:13:38,341 --> 00:13:41,177
Ryuji Asato is a male kickboxer.

196
00:13:41,511 --> 00:13:43,179
Yeah. That's me.

197
00:13:43,413 --> 00:13:46,349
Ryuji is my ring name.

198
00:14:00,897 --> 00:14:04,734
Ryuji Asato. An undefeated champion. 50 wins in 50 fights.

199
00:14:05,635 --> 00:14:07,704
His showstopper is the flying knee kick.

200
00:14:08,438 --> 00:14:12,709
But Ryuji disappeared last winter and has been missing ever since.

201
00:14:13,309 --> 00:14:15,879
Are you saying he's a woman now?

202
00:14:16,079 --> 00:14:18,548
Now that you mention it, you do look alike...

203
00:14:20,717 --> 00:14:22,552
Why change your appearance?

204
00:14:23,353 --> 00:14:26,556
I had someone I loved with all my heart.

205
00:14:26,756 --> 00:14:30,226
His name was Iwao Gantetsu, and he was my kickboxing coach.

206
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:34,697
I loved him so much, and I was determined to marry him.

207
00:14:34,898 --> 00:14:36,532
And so you quit kickboxing?

208
00:14:36,866 --> 00:14:37,667
Yes.

209
00:14:37,867 --> 00:14:42,205
I trained hard to get to where I am today.

210
00:14:42,405 --> 00:14:44,540
But fate was cruel.

211
00:14:44,741 --> 00:14:47,043
My coach moved to another country.

212
00:14:47,243 --> 00:14:50,046
Does this coach happen to be a lot like Ryo-chan?

213
00:14:50,246 --> 00:14:52,015
Yes, they are exactly alike.

214
00:14:52,215 --> 00:14:54,050
He's my ideal type.

215
00:14:54,250 --> 00:14:56,352
So it was love at first sight...

216
00:14:56,753 --> 00:15:00,924
I thought I was a good matchmaker, but it was just two guys...

217
00:15:02,558 --> 00:15:05,395
I'm back from patrol!

218
00:15:05,595 --> 00:15:07,530
Ryo-sama, welcome back!

219
00:15:08,031 --> 00:15:10,566
I missed you so much.

220
00:15:10,767 --> 00:15:13,269
Don't worry. I'm back now.

221
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:16,706
This should be a heartwarming scene, but...

222
00:15:16,906 --> 00:15:19,042
Not after hearing that story...

223
00:15:19,442 --> 00:15:22,378
Ta-da! Check it out, Chief!

224
00:15:23,079 --> 00:15:26,883
Once we sign and submit this, Maria and I will officially be married.

225
00:15:27,083 --> 00:15:27,984
I'm so happy!

226
00:15:28,217 --> 00:15:31,387
We need witnesses, so that means you, Nakagawa and Reiko!

227
00:15:31,587 --> 00:15:32,388
R-Right...

228
00:15:32,588 --> 00:15:34,624
-What great news... -Yeah, great...

229
00:15:35,058 --> 00:15:36,225
Let's see...

230
00:15:36,426 --> 00:15:37,460
"The husband."

231
00:15:37,694 --> 00:15:39,228
I guess that's me.

232
00:15:39,429 --> 00:15:40,697
What should we do?

233
00:15:40,897 --> 00:15:42,999
We need to tell him!

234
00:15:43,232 --> 00:15:46,769
But he'll never believe us.

235
00:15:49,439 --> 00:15:51,808
Ryotsu, Maria is actually a man.

236
00:15:52,008 --> 00:15:54,243
What?! You old scoundrel.

237
00:15:54,444 --> 00:15:57,180
You need to be more creative with your lies.

238
00:15:57,413 --> 00:16:01,918
Hey, I'll bet you're just jealous that I get to marry such a babe!

239
00:16:02,118 --> 00:16:04,787
Just you wait for our honeymoon period.

240
00:16:04,988 --> 00:16:07,991
That'll make you even more jealous!

241
00:16:11,961 --> 00:16:14,130
-That's how it'd go. -Yeah.

242
00:16:14,630 --> 00:16:16,399
He's gotta hear it firsthand.

243
00:16:16,599 --> 00:16:18,634
You'd force a lady to confess?

244
00:16:18,835 --> 00:16:20,336
But isn't she a man?

245
00:16:20,570 --> 00:16:22,772
-Oh, right. -Gah, what do we do?

246
00:16:22,972 --> 00:16:24,207
Done!

247
00:16:24,574 --> 00:16:26,409
Now we just need to stamp it.

248
00:16:26,809 --> 00:16:28,444
We can't let him submit it.

249
00:16:28,644 --> 00:16:29,679
I know what.

250
00:16:30,113 --> 00:16:31,981
Ryotsu, how about some tea?

251
00:16:35,885 --> 00:16:38,154
Sorry. I didn't do it on purpose.

252
00:16:38,354 --> 00:16:41,024
I guess you won't be able to submit it today.

253
00:16:41,224 --> 00:16:42,458
No problem.

254
00:16:42,658 --> 00:16:46,362
Ta-da! I brought a backup just in case.

255
00:16:46,963 --> 00:16:48,865
Oh, what a relief...

256
00:16:49,065 --> 00:16:50,500
Let's see...

257
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:51,501
"Ryotsu..."

258
00:16:51,701 --> 00:16:54,036
Watch out! A poisonous spider!

259
00:16:58,841 --> 00:17:02,712
I'm sorry, it was just a regular spider. I didn't mean any harm.

260
00:17:02,912 --> 00:17:04,547
No problem.

261
00:17:05,047 --> 00:17:06,549
I still have another backup.

262
00:17:08,051 --> 00:17:10,053
How many backups did you bring?

263
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:13,790
I wanted to ensure our marriage was a done deal.

264
00:17:13,990 --> 00:17:14,724
Ta-da!

265
00:17:14,924 --> 00:17:17,794
I came back with all the forms they had.

266
00:17:18,027 --> 00:17:19,262
That's wonderful!

267
00:17:21,364 --> 00:17:24,801
We'll just have to drop hints to make him realize it himself.

268
00:17:26,002 --> 00:17:27,336
Ryotsu, we need to talk.

269
00:17:27,537 --> 00:17:29,806
Why? I'm about to go to the city office...

270
00:17:30,206 --> 00:17:31,707
Just come with me.

271
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:39,081
Ryotsu, what is "marriage" to you?

272
00:17:39,649 --> 00:17:41,417
Why so serious all of a sudden?

273
00:17:41,651 --> 00:17:45,288
Weren't you the one pushing for us to get married before?

274
00:17:46,089 --> 00:17:49,058
Jealous you're not the one who picked her?

275
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:50,893
No, that's not it!

276
00:17:51,194 --> 00:17:54,831
What I'm trying to say is marriage shouldn't be done on a whim.

277
00:17:55,031 --> 00:17:59,836
You do know they don't call it "the ball and chain" for no reason?

278
00:18:00,036 --> 00:18:02,605
Maybe for you, Chief, but not me.

279
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:05,842
Maria and I will be forever on cloud nine!

280
00:18:06,209 --> 00:18:10,780
I'm telling you, Ryotsu, it's gonna be hell once you find out who she really is!

281
00:18:12,415 --> 00:18:15,918
You shouldn't get married based on just appearances.

282
00:18:16,118 --> 00:18:18,287
It's the person inside that counts.

283
00:18:18,521 --> 00:18:21,457
Maria's a nice girl. You know this, Chief.

284
00:18:21,691 --> 00:18:23,459
There's more to people than that!

285
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:26,562
Like, you should at least know a person

286
00:18:26,762 --> 00:18:30,466
by visiting a hot spring together before getting married.

287
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:34,570
Maria would be in the women's bath. I can't go in there!

288
00:18:34,770 --> 00:18:35,738
Well, you see...

289
00:18:35,938 --> 00:18:37,940
Oh, I get it, Chief.

290
00:18:38,141 --> 00:18:39,442
Oh! Has he caught on?

291
00:18:39,642 --> 00:18:43,412
You want me to take Maria to a mixed bath

292
00:18:43,613 --> 00:18:45,548
so you can join as well, don't you?

293
00:18:45,748 --> 00:18:48,451
Hey! Make room for me!

294
00:18:48,651 --> 00:18:51,954
Wow, you're quite the pervert. Aren't you, Chief?

295
00:18:52,989 --> 00:18:57,460
How is he so annoyingly perceptive except for the one time he needs to be?

296
00:18:57,660 --> 00:18:59,195
What I'm saying is,

297
00:18:59,428 --> 00:19:03,499
if you take a bath together, you might find something unexpected!

298
00:19:03,733 --> 00:19:05,001
Something unexpected?

299
00:19:05,201 --> 00:19:07,737
Yes. Something incredibly unexpected.

300
00:19:07,937 --> 00:19:11,974
So unexpected it'll make you choke!

301
00:19:12,175 --> 00:19:13,442
What I mean is...

302
00:19:13,976 --> 00:19:14,810
Maria!

303
00:19:16,979 --> 00:19:18,447
Kei-chan!

304
00:19:24,453 --> 00:19:28,658
These guys are professional wrestlers back home.

305
00:19:28,858 --> 00:19:33,829
Give us any trouble, and they'll put you to sleep just like him.

306
00:19:34,030 --> 00:19:37,466
Hell yeah! We're gonna have some fun today, boys!

307
00:19:37,667 --> 00:19:40,536
Hey! What are you doing to my Maria!

308
00:19:40,870 --> 00:19:42,505
-Ryo-sama! -Not you again.

309
00:19:42,705 --> 00:19:44,340
Get him, boys!

310
00:19:54,317 --> 00:19:56,219
Ryotsu is so intense!

311
00:19:56,419 --> 00:19:58,354
You can tell he's fighting for love.

312
00:19:58,554 --> 00:19:59,789
Ryo-sama!

313
00:20:10,833 --> 00:20:13,002
Now! Beat him to a pulp!

314
00:20:18,207 --> 00:20:19,241
Ryo-sama!

315
00:20:19,442 --> 00:20:21,210
Not so fast. Where are you going?

316
00:20:25,581 --> 00:20:28,351
Nobody lays a finger on my Ryo-sama!

317
00:20:34,390 --> 00:20:37,193
That's a former kickboxing champion for you.

318
00:20:37,593 --> 00:20:40,263
This is for hitting my Ryo-sama!

319
00:20:47,470 --> 00:20:48,604
Hmm? What's going on?

320
00:20:54,143 --> 00:20:54,944
I know that!

321
00:20:55,711 --> 00:21:00,283
That's Ryuji Asato's showstopper, the flying knee kick!

322
00:21:03,252 --> 00:21:05,287
How does Maria know that move?

323
00:21:07,923 --> 00:21:08,724
Ryo-sama!

324
00:21:11,394 --> 00:21:13,295
Are you okay?

325
00:21:13,896 --> 00:21:15,331
It's just a few scratches.

326
00:21:15,564 --> 00:21:16,165
Huh?!

327
00:21:16,332 --> 00:21:20,136
What's this? Something squishy is pressing against my head.

328
00:21:20,569 --> 00:21:21,637
Don't tell me!

329
00:21:23,939 --> 00:21:25,975
Gimme a sec...

330
00:21:26,409 --> 00:21:27,243
No!

331
00:21:29,979 --> 00:21:33,249
What's that between your legs, Maria?!

332
00:21:34,417 --> 00:21:37,253
Don't point... You have one too, Ryo-sama.

333
00:21:38,654 --> 00:21:40,256
Then what about your boobs?

334
00:21:40,523 --> 00:21:42,258
This is just padding.

335
00:21:44,627 --> 00:21:47,730
So you're a M...A...N?

336
00:21:50,266 --> 00:21:54,737
"MAN"

337
00:21:57,139 --> 00:21:58,908
Looks like he finally realized.

338
00:21:59,108 --> 00:22:02,611
I wish we could have let him down a little easier.

339
00:22:02,812 --> 00:22:04,480
There was nothing we could do.

340
00:22:04,680 --> 00:22:05,748
Ryo-sama!

341
00:22:05,948 --> 00:22:07,650
You came to save me.

342
00:22:07,850 --> 00:22:09,185
I'm so happy!

343
00:22:09,385 --> 00:22:11,654
Our love is truly eternal!

344
00:22:11,854 --> 00:22:14,990
When shall we have the ceremony? What about the honeymoon?

345
00:22:16,559 --> 00:22:17,927
Don't be ridiculous!

346
00:22:18,127 --> 00:22:20,563
You think I'm gonna marry you after this?

347
00:22:20,796 --> 00:22:25,367
But you said you'd marry me, and you signed the marriage certificate.

348
00:22:25,568 --> 00:22:28,003
Yeah, when I thought you were a woman!

349
00:22:28,204 --> 00:22:31,140
I'm not about to marry a man!

350
00:22:34,944 --> 00:22:40,483
And I thought I'd finally met the one...

351
00:22:49,558 --> 00:22:51,160
I feel kind of bad.

352
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:53,395
How cruel! Making her cry like that.

353
00:22:53,596 --> 00:22:55,030
She's a man!

354
00:22:55,231 --> 00:22:58,367
Hell, I feel like crying too.

355
00:22:58,667 --> 00:23:03,839
At least I won't have to be the matchmaker for a same-sex wedding.

356
00:23:07,276 --> 00:23:10,079
I wonder how Maria is doing right now?

357
00:23:10,279 --> 00:23:12,014
So it is eating you up?

358
00:23:12,214 --> 00:23:14,049
You should have just got married.

359
00:23:14,450 --> 00:23:15,751
Don't be silly!

360
00:23:16,085 --> 00:23:19,822
We had a bad breakup, so that's what's bothering me.

361
00:23:20,723 --> 00:23:22,291
I hope I wasn't too harsh...

362
00:23:28,030 --> 00:23:29,265
Heyo!

363
00:23:29,932 --> 00:23:31,367
Ugh, it's the pigs.

364
00:23:31,567 --> 00:23:33,235
Who you callin' pigs?

365
00:23:33,436 --> 00:23:37,473
We're showing a new officer around the district today.

366
00:23:37,706 --> 00:23:38,874
Come say hello.

367
00:23:50,486 --> 00:23:51,754
Ryo-sama!

368
00:23:51,954 --> 00:23:56,725
I couldn't get over you, so I joined the police to stay by your side forever!

369
00:23:56,926 --> 00:23:58,761
Hell hath no fury...

370
00:23:58,961 --> 00:24:01,230
She's a man!
